{
  "_comment": [
    "Manual bridges between NVMC and SailClear country vocabularies.",
    "222 of NVMC's 242 names align with SailClear automatically once you",
    "uppercase, de-invert 'X, Y' forms and strip punctuation. These 20 do not.",
    "Keys are the NVMC name; values are the exact SailClear string, or null",
    "where SailClear has no equivalent."
  ],
