  "_alpha3Comment": [
    "Passport MRZ lines carry ISO 3166-1 alpha-3, so OCR may return 'USA' or",
    "'GBR' rather than a country name. NVMC's own table only supplies alpha-2,",
    "so alpha-3 is curated here. Covers the nationalities that actually appear",
    "on Caribbean charters; anything missing falls through unmapped and is",
    "rejected by the target rather than silently mis-filed."
  ],
